      "content": "i get that but it hurts so bad i cant even sleep. i already have a sterile needle and some rubbing alcohol ready. if i just make a tiny little nick in the skin to let the pus out, isn't that basically what a doctor does? it seems like it would be way easier and safer to just do a quick drain at home than to deal with a massive hospital bill.",
